 "description": "<p>Sarfannguit (old spelling: Sarfannguaq / Sarfánguaq) is a settlement in the Qeqqata municipality in central-western Greenland. Its population was 126 in 2010.[2] The settlement was founded in 1843. Source: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarfannguit\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a></p><p>For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=33\" target=\"_blank\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a></p>",
